{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "64600a01-8f13-43ad-84c6-d8d50c82a382",
    "name": "ZoodeSIM User API",
    "description": "Mirrors `routes/api.php`. User APIs only (no admin HTTP APIs).\n\n**User (Sanctum Bearer `token`)**\n- `POST /api/promo/validate`\n- `POST /api/user/register` · `POST /api/user/login` · `POST /api/user/logout` · `GET /api/user/profile`\n- `GET /api/user/wallet` · `POST /api/user/wallet` · `GET /api/user/transactions` (`page`, `per_page`)\n- `GET /api/user/notifications` · `POST /api/user/notifications/read-all` · `POST /api/user/notifications/{notification}/read`\n- `GET /api/user/esim/countries` · `GET /api/user/esim/packages` · `GET /api/user/esim/orders` · `POST /api/user/esim/orders` · `GET /api/user/esim/orders/{order}`\n\n**Setup**\n1. Import this collection and `User_API.postman_environment.json`.\n2. Select the **ZoodeSIM User API — Local** environment.\n3. Set `baseUrl` if needed (`https://esim.test` for Herd, or `http://localhost`).\n4. Register and Login both save `token` for protected user requests. Run Wallet after login.\n\n**Locale**\nUse `lang` (`en`, `es`, `ru`, `fr`, `de`, `tg`) as `?lang=` or `Accept-Language`.\n\n**Envelope**\n```json\n{ \"success\": true, \"message\": \"...\", \"data\": {}, \"errors\": null }\n{ \"success\": false, \"message\": \"...\", \"data\": null, \"errors\": {} }\n```",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "29209019"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Register",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register with valid referral code",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 201', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.success && json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('token', json.data.token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.data.token);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Returns token, user, and eligible bonus', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.bonus_mb).to.be.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.include.keys('bonus_type', 'bonus_amount', 'bonus_mb');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.token_type).to.eql('Bearer');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"{{name}}\",\n    \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n    \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n    \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n    \"password_confirmation\": \"{{password}}\",\n    \"referral_code\": \"{{referral_code}}\",\n    \"device_id\": \"{{device_id}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/user/register?lang={{lang}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "user",
                "register"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "lang",
                  "value": "{{lang}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Set `referral_code` to the partner’s currently active promo. Locked ladder codes are rejected (422 `api.promo.locked`); only the live unlocked code works. Also provisions a ResellPortal client server-side (not returned in JSON). Returns Bearer token, user, and `{ bonus_type, bonus_amount, bonus_mb }`. `bonus_mb` is the MB grant (0 for Reward Dollars). Use a unique email/phone each run."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
